y. Continuously fuse and upgrade your creatures to reach the ultimate goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570110/extras/69603ae650becff2d8528fd498d95ed2.poster.avif?t=1754559402\" width=610 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570110/extras/69603ae650becff2d8528fd498d95ed2.webm?t=1754559402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570110/extras/69603ae650becff2d8528fd498d95ed2.mp4?t=1754559402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570110/extras/cc78459836f886a3b1c7001d42909f49.avif?t=1754559402\" width=616 height=147 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeated the final boss? Is it truly over? Rich online battle modes await\u2014experience the thrill of asynchronous duels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570110/extras/41674f692c3eda78cbc9b7bfcc49afe6.poster.avif?t=1754559402\" width=610 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570110/extras/41674f692c3eda78cbc9b7bfcc49afe6.webm?t=1754559402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570110/extras/41674f692c3eda78cbc9b7bfcc49afe6.mp4?t=1754559402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Summoner's Gambit is an innovative duel game that blends strategy roguelike with auto-battler positioning. As a powerful summoner, you'll forge a dominant formation and clash against other players on the ever-shifting battlefield, where wit and luck collide.",
